          "evidence_note": "PoolManager accepts additional connection-pool keyword arguments before urllib3 1.9, but urllib3 1.8.3 HTTPConnectionPool does not expose retries as a pool configuration parameter. urllib3 1.9 introduces retries as an explicit HTTPConnectionPool parameter and PoolManager forwards its connection_pool_kw to the pool constructor. The selected retries=0 form remains accepted at the vulnerable 2.4.0 boundary and at fixed release 2.5.0."
